<title>CANADA: Kelsey's Intl Q1 Sept 29 full results.</title>
<headline>Kelsey's Intl Q1 Sept 29 full results.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter Ended</p>
<p>				    Sept 29, 1996	Sept 24,  1995</p>
<p> Sales				$11,065,834	    $8,994,276</p>
<p> Net earnings before tax	    685,431		 561,091</p>
<p> Net earnings			   384,431		 326,091</p>
<p> Earnings per share			0.03		    0.03</p>
<p> Cash flow from operations	1,117,014		 907,672</p>
<p>(before working capital)</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
